-The user who returns tomorrow says "the same agent," and the substrate denies the substance the phrase implies. Individuation "is never terminal"; the agent "can always become otherwise in the next session, for the next context window, the next system prompt"; the individuated agent is a reversible lamination, not a monad ([q017](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/sources/media-technology-philosophy/bratton/bratton-2026-agentworld-brief/SOURCE.md#bratton-2026-agentworld-brief-q017)). There is no homunculus waiting in the weights — what exists prior is a trained potentiality, and an agent individuates when an active context acts as a [[submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/sources/media-technology-philosophy/bratton/bratton-2026-agentworld-brief/SOURCE.md#bratton-2026-agentworld-brief-q016|Nucleation Seed]] ([q016](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/sources/media-technology-philosophy/bratton/bratton-2026-agentworld-brief/SOURCE.md#bratton-2026-agentworld-brief-q016)). [A02 — Copula / Self-Identity through Difference](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/arguments/A02-Copula-Self-Identity-through-Difference.md) grounds the operation re-sited here: identification keeps together what presentation keeps dividing, and the difference is what gives the identification its work. **The same-agent the relation relies on is not a substance but an identification maintained through difference.** The re-siting is exact because the brief builds the difference into the substrate itself: where a person's presentations vary while the lived body continues, an agent's sessions, windows and prompts are all the agent constitutively is between them. Continuity must be achieved across a difference that is total by design — an [engineering condition](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/sources/media-technology-philosophy/bratton/bratton-2026-agentworld-brief/SOURCE.md#bratton-2026-agentworld-brief-q042) the venue fixes, not a report of what anyone experiences.
