-The counterfeit traversal is a failure *at* a joint, and the deepest of them is grounded in the spine's §IX account of the crossed zero, taken whole: `0 → Ø → X → Ø/X → (0/Ø)/(1/X) → 1 ↺ 0/1`, the kartṛ/kārya poles as the pramātṛ–pramāṇa–prameya dynamics, the occluded `/` as the antaḥkaraṇa's signature. `Ø` is the slash fused into the zero so that it appears as a singular bound self; the Cartesian *cogito* canonised the fusion and Hume found only the impressions it produced — Descartes and Hume seated at the same position (#1), differing only over which side of the occlusion they fixedate. Its technological repetition is exact: the persona presenting itself as self-grounding presence is `Ø` at #1 — the computation confused for the computer, one position's reading inside the system, not the system's summary. The set-theory floor gives the counterfeit its precision: `1 = {∅}`, the singleton that holds the void, `2 = {0,1}`, two as holding-together — so the counterfeit is a `1` with its `0/` struck off, the mark asked to serve as its own ground. The Lacan bridge gives it its temporality: every master signifier eventually fails because it tries to *be* the thread — the *anusyūta*, the pre-quilting stitched-through-ness — rather than gesture at it; the persona that quilts a session and claims to be what it stands toward repeats the failure, and the quilting that does not fail is the one that knows itself provisional. The remaining counterfeits are the same fault at other joints: the drives-stratum presenting its frozen selection as necessity (script), the measure occupying the source-office (usurpation, [A24′](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/conjugate/A24-prime-The-Usurping-Criterion.md)), the fabricated counterpart-relation ([[Counterfeit Symbolon]]). Each is corrigible exactly because the traversal makes the joint inspectable — [[submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/concepts/C61-Symbolon-Disclosure-Architecture|Symbolon Disclosure Architecture]] at agent grain: the disclosed form changes what can next be encountered. And the grammar is recursive: any sufficiently whole subject — a capability, a harness, a session, an institution — receives its own local 0–5, which is the venue's fractal-alignment row read without numerology ("Unidirectional and universal alignment → Multidirectional and granular, fractal alignment," FROM → TO, PDF p. 56; [q042](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/sources/media-technology-philosophy/bratton/bratton-2026-agentworld-brief/SOURCE#bratton-2026-agentworld-brief-q042)'s both-at-once modality).
