 ### What the named act costs and returns
 
 A18’s whole Name series — Truth, Mind, Word, Logos, Son, Image — retains its coequal Power series — Play, Need, Sacrifice, Decision, Love, Work. The technological act has both faces: its articulated name and the capacities, expenditure and consequences through which that articulation becomes effective. A named result cannot substitute for the power that made and sustains it. The four offices developed here arise within this particular act; they leave the two complete series and the eight determinations intact.
 
-Sacrifice becomes determinate expenditure. The act takes time, attention, energy and labour from a field which had other possible uses for them. A request answered at negligible visible cost can still depend upon work and infrastructure outside the session’s view. The act must be able to state what was committed and what remained unavailable to it. This is the [Apportionment / Economy whole field](submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/etymologies/apportionment-and-economy/WHOLE-FIELD.md)’s **delegated labour distributes capacity and return** operation at evidence register 3. Particular costs require their actual records; the native requirement to retain expenditure does not wait upon inventing a measurement.
